mw2coop patch for maps/gulag_ending_code.gsc (The Gulag, Modern Warfare 2, 64-bit Steam build)
Co-op logic lives in mw2coop/scripts/maps/_mw2coop_gulag.gsc.

1. The cave-in chase out of the tunnels is for both players: each one's screen darkens by his own
   distance to the collapse, and it buries whichever player it catches or who runs the wrong way
   (before, only player 1 was followed: a lagging player 2 was never caught; QA tour 2026-10-22).
   Being buried fails the mission for both, as dying there does alone.
@@@ subst chase_train_kills_player_if_it_gets_close
level.black_overlay fadeOverTime( 0.2 );
@@@ to
level.black_overlay fadeOverTime( 0.2 );
		maps\_mw2coop_gulag::partner_chase_fade( self.origin, max_black, black_range );
@@@ end
@@@ subst chase_train_kills_player_if_it_gets_close
if ( chase_dist < 260 )
@@@ to
if ( maps\_mw2coop_gulag::cavein_catches( self.origin, chase_dist, 260 ) )
@@@ end
@@@ subst chase_player_dies_if_goes_wrong_way
if ( level.player istouching( volume ) )
@@@ to
if ( maps\_mw2coop_gulag::anyone_touching( volume ) )
@@@ end
@@@ subst black_screen
level.black_overlay destroy();
@@@ to
level.black_overlay destroy();
		maps\_mw2coop_gulag::partner_black_screen( false );
@@@ end
@@@ subst black_screen
level.black_overlay = hud;
@@@ to
level.black_overlay = hud;
	maps\_mw2coop_gulag::partner_black_screen( true );
@@@ end
@@@ subst player_dies_to_cavein
if ( flag( "player_died_to_cave_in" ) )
@@@ to
maps\_mw2coop_gulag::cavein_default();
	if ( flag( "player_died_to_cave_in" ) )
@@@ end
@@@ subst player_dies_to_cavein
level.player
@@@ to
level.mw2coop_cavein_player
@@@ end
@@@ subst black_death
level.player
@@@ to
